    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=38^\\circ$",
      "worked": "The angle opposite the diameter is $90^\\circ$ (angle in a semicircle). Using the angle sum of a triangle:\n$$\\begin{align*}x&=180^\\circ-90^\\circ-52^\\circ\\\\x&=38^\\circ\\end{align*}$$",
